        <description>Helped create a startup that aimed to simplify access to legislation and other government-related information in Portugal.</description>
      </item>
      <item>
        <period>Mar 2010 – Apr 2013</period>
        <title>Full-stack engineer at <a href="https://lis.ipn.pt">IPN LIS</a></title>
